## Formal ontology mappings

- **SIOC 2007** `sioc:previous_by_date` — exact semantic match
- Companion of `sioc:next_by_date` in SIOC's pairwise-navigation convention

## Inverse-of relation

`previous-by-date` is the canonical inverse of `next-by-date`.  When `:dt/inverse-of :mm.memory/next-by-date` is declared, `sandbar.db.entailment.core/prp-inv1` and `prp-inv2` derive each direction from the other — substrate declares one side; queries see both.

